      "year": 2023,
      "abstract": "In this paper, we propose a novel formulation to obtain the small SAR constellation that optimizes revisit times in the worst, average, and best scenario over a given Region of Concern (ROC). We demonstrate this formulation for selected Indian regions via detailed System Tool Kit (STK) simulations to get the optimum constellations.",
